WEBVTT

00:04:29.356 --> 00:04:33.516
for our physical,
not to mention mental, health.

00:04:34.156 --> 00:04:36.636
There are a lot of things
that need to change,

00:04:36.636 --> 00:04:38.676
but that won't happen overnight,

00:04:38.716 --> 00:04:41.676
such as our work schedules, wages,

00:04:41.716 --> 00:04:46.556
the availability of healthy,
affordable foods in every community

00:04:46.596 --> 00:04:49.196
and public spaces that make walking,

00:04:49.236 --> 00:04:54.556
biking and hiking safe,
accessible and inviting.

00:04:55.676 --> 00:04:56.836
As a society,

00:04:56.836 --> 00:05:01.036
we need to start thinking
about these things as not only luxuries